error[DS0105]: SQL keyword `AND` in capitals
  --> query:1:38
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | where amount > 1 AND amount < 5 OR customerId == 'c'
  |                                      ^^^ this is SQL
  |
  = help: write `and` in lowercase: `amount > 1 and amount < 5`

